    "traits": "Alteration, Invested",
    "description": "<p><strong>ALTERATION INVESTED</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Level</strong> 6; <strong>Price</strong> 2,000 gp; <strong>Usage</strong> worn; <strong>Weight</strong> -</p>\n<p><em>A strand of smooth, ivory prayer beads, each bead engraved with intricate symbols of tranquillity and enlightenment.</em></p>\n<p>Any character who invests these beads gains a +1 status bonus to their Wisdom ability score. Additionally, once per day, you gain advantage on a Refocus (Mental Focus) check made while holding or wearing the beads.</p>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> invested, +1 status to Wisdom. Its Use (free, once a day) readies advantage on your next Refocus that day, taken automatically on that roll (interpretation 4); an unused one lapses at your daily preparation.</p>",
